    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present this well positioned three bedroom mid terrace family home, ideally situated in a quiet and mature residential setting.\n\nThe property requires modernisation but offers spacious well proportioned accommodation extending to approximately 87 sq m. The home also benefits from a generous rear lawned garden, mature trees and established shrubbery, all enclosed by surrounding walls that provide an excellent level of privacy.\n\nAccommodation comprises an entrance hallway, large living room, dining room, kitchen/breakfast room, three bedrooms and a main family bathroom. Further benefits include gas fired radiator central heating and a large gated private driveway providing ample off street parking for several cars.\n\nThe location is particularly appealing, with a host of amenities close by, including excellent schools, regular bus routes, local shops, DCU and The Helix. The property is ideally suited to families and those seeking a comfortable home in an established and highly sought after residential area.\n\nViewing is very highly recommended to appreciate the accommodation, potential and excellent location this property has to offer.\n\nContact DNG Estate Agents in Phibsboro.\nLocal DNG agents: Isabel O'Neill, Brian McGee, Vincent Mullen, Leah Barry, Michelle Keeley & Ciaran Jones MIPAV"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.76m x 3.87m\nWelcoming entrance hallway with carpet flooring, wallpapered walls and useful understairs storage.\n\nLiving Room - 5.06m x 3.06m\nBright dual aspect living room with carpet flooring, wallpapered walls and a decorative fireplace with gas insert.\n\nDining Room - 3.20m x 3.00m\nCurrently used as a 4th bedroom, this versatile room would also make an ideal dining room. The room features carpet flooring and wallpapered walls.\n\nKitchen/Dining area - 5.06m x 2.37m\nThe kitchen requires full modernisation and retains its original floor tiling. A door provides direct access to the large rear garden.\n\nLanding - 1.89m x 3.23m\nLanding area with carpet flooring and wallpapered walls.\n\nBedroom 1 - 5.06m x 3.03m\nGenerously proportioned dual aspect double bedroom with carpet flooring and painted walls.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.08m x 3.07m\nRear facing double bedroom with carpet flooring and painted walls.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.08m x 2.36m\nSituated to the rear of the property, this versatile single room would make an ideal child's bedroom or home office. The room features carpet flooring and wallpapered walls.\n\nBathroom - 1.89m x 2.21m\nFully tiled family bathroom comprising bath, wash hand basin and wc.\n\nOutside rear - \nStunning mature garden featuring a generous seeded lawn, mature trees and established shrubbery, creating a private and secluded outdoor space.\n\nOutside front - \nLarge, gated private driveway providing ample off street parking for several cars.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Year of construction 1947</li><li> Gas Heating</li><li> Mature 3 bedroom residence</li><li> Multiple barna storage sheds</li><li> Large mature rear garden</li><li> Private gated driveway</li><li> Walking distance to local schools, DCU, Botanic gardens, bus routes, shops and sports facilities</li><li> Close to M50, Dublin Airport and City Centre</ul>"
      },
      {
